(6532198, 970251, 100831, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get time to comment during the challenge but this was a high score from me. There are so many things to enjoy here. Love it!</td>', 'I didn''t get time to comment during the challenge but this was a high score from me. There are so many things to enjoy here. Love it!', '2011-09-07 21:07:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6532205, 970237, 66952, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> 1/125s according to the image data.  I assume that is a data entry error, right?  If so, then big congratulations on the Blue ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>He used flashes. There''s no way possible to freeze the action like this with shutter speed alone.<br/> <br/>William, fantastic! I didn''t vote, but you''d get a 10 from me.</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: 1/125s according to the image data.  I assume that is a data entry error, right?  If so, then big congratulations on the Blue ribbon.   He used flashes. There''s no way possible to freeze the action like this with shutter speed alone. William, fantastic! I didn''t vote, but you''d get a 10 from me.', '2011-09-07 21:10:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6532224, 970237, 103142, '<td valign="top">So beautifully done!! I can''t believe you''re able to stop motion with 1/125. That even blurs seagulls. Are you using flash to stop it?<br/> <br/>(Ooops, just read the other comments. :)</td>', 'So beautifully done!! I can''t believe you''re able to stop motion with 1/125. That even blurs seagulls. Are you using flash to stop it? (Ooops, just read the other comments. :)', '2011-09-07 21:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6532225, 969313, 103142, '<td valign="top">Awesome!! Thanks for the info on the setup!<br/> <br/>Oh and congrats on the first ribbon!!! First of many, I''m sure. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-09-07 20:26:18.</i></td>', 'Awesome!! Thanks for the info on the setup! Oh and congrats on the first ribbon!!! First of many, I''m sure. :)', '2011-09-07 21:23:06.000000', '2011-09-07 21:26:18.000000', 0),
