(6532642, 969676, 113411, '<td valign="top">Great score for a first entry Deb! This will be fun for you.</td>', 'Great score for a first entry Deb! This will be fun for you.', '2011-09-08 00:22:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6532654, 970237, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ann:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> 1/125s according to the image data.  I assume that is a data entry error, right?  If so, then big congratulations on the Blue ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>He used flashes. There''s no way possible to freeze the action like this with shutter speed alone.<br/> <br/>William, fantastic! I didn''t vote, but you''d get a 10 from me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are right! Hummingbird''s wings are way too fast to be stopped motion by shutter. You will see some motion blur even with 1/1000 shutter speed.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ann: Originally posted by hahn23: 1/125s according to the image data.  I assume that is a data entry error, right?  If so, then big congratulations on the Blue ribbon.   He used flashes. There''s no way possible to freeze the action like this with shutter speed alone. William, fantastic! I didn''t vote, but you''d get a 10 from me.   You are right! Hummingbird''s wings are way too fast to be stopped motion by shutter. You will see some motion blur even with 1/1000 shutter speed.', '2011-09-08 00:36:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6532760, 970141, 59267, '<td valign="top">10-22??? they were so friendly to you!<br/>Awesome shot! congratulations!</td>', '10-22??? they were so friendly to you!Awesome shot! congratulations!', '2011-09-08 01:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533067, 970024, 135744, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback. I was on holiday and only managed to take a few hurried shots whilst holding my 2 dogs in one hand and rushing back to the car. I really wanted to go back and try and put more effort into the shot but unfortunately my 4 month old daughter put a stop to that. Shame as it was a really great opportunity for this particular challenge.</td>', 'Thanks for the feedback. I was on holiday and only managed to take a few hurried shots whilst holding my 2 dogs in one hand and rushing back to the car. I really wanted to go back and try and put more effort into the shot but unfortunately my 4 month old daughter put a stop to that. Shame as it was a really great opportunity for this particular challenge.', '2011-09-08 06:42:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533221, 970237, 51597, '<td valign="top">I knew this wasn''t possible b/c i''ve been  practicing shooting hummers all summer. One thing which was helpful to me is i ck''d out your settings on other shot''s u''ve posted and learned to &gt; shutter even more than i have been. Summers coming to close so no more hummer shots til next yr.</td>', 'I knew this wasn''t possible b/c i''ve been  practicing shooting hummers all summer. One thing which was helpful to me is i ck''d out your settings on other shot''s u''ve posted and learned to > shutter even more than i have been. Summers coming to close so no more hummer shots til next yr.', '2011-09-08 11:26:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533244, 969313, 83184, '<td valign="top">Oh, that is very cool! I didn''t even realize that it is a spoon you are dropping them into, looks like the strawberry is hittimng a stream of milk in midair. Very well done, and thanks for explaining!<br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'Oh, that is very cool! I didn''t even realize that it is a spoon you are dropping them into, looks like the strawberry is hittimng a stream of milk in midair. Very well done, and thanks for explaining!Congratulations!', '2011-09-08 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533351, 969562, 69368, '<td valign="top">Nice image and really nice finish, Especially for the first entry</td>', 'Nice image and really nice finish, Especially for the first entry', '2011-09-08 14:21:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533404, 970251, 16106, '<td valign="top">Sadly the score isn''t as good as the image, mostly I suspect because in a <i>stopped motion</i> challenge the blurred motion of the ball really took points away for the DNMC sticklers. It probably would have done better in F.S. I love the energy you got in this image, but I wish you could have isolated the kid more (framing out the bystanders, shooting from lower down ect.) and really made him look heroic.</td>', 'Sadly the score isn''t as good as the image, mostly I suspect because in a stopped motion challenge the blurred motion of the ball really took points away for the DNMC sticklers. It probably would have done better in F.S. I love the energy you got in this image, but I wish you could have isolated the kid more (framing out the bystanders, shooting from lower down ect.) and really made him look heroic.', '2011-09-08 15:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533589, 970237, 130849, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!!  Beautiful clarity and detail!</td>', 'Congrats!!!  Beautiful clarity and detail!', '2011-09-08 18:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533596, 970141, 130849, '<td valign="top">Congrats Wendy!!</td>', 'Congrats Wendy!!', '2011-09-08 18:55:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533603, 969313, 130849, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  And thanks for sharing your set up and trials!</td>', 'Congrats!  And thanks for sharing your set up and trials!', '2011-09-08 19:00:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533664, 969562, 124700, '<td valign="top">Thank you Christiane. It was quite a pleasant shock to be scoring so well. lol  I can only hope over time that I am as successful as you''ve been with your photos.</td>', 'Thank you Christiane. It was quite a pleasant shock to be scoring so well. lol  I can only hope over time that I am as successful as you''ve been with your photos.', '2011-09-08 20:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534818, 970251, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is extraordinary. I meant to say that earlier. The sheer determination of it, the awesome raw power of the athleticism, and all this from what, a 6-year old? Kid''s gonna grow into a hell of an athlete... I gave you an 8.</td>', 'This is extraordinary. I meant to say that earlier. The sheer determination of it, the awesome raw power of the athleticism, and all this from what, a 6-year old? Kid''s gonna grow into a hell of an athlete... I gave you an 8.', '2011-09-09 12:56:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6535345, 969966, 87278, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!</td>', 'Breathtaking!', '2011-09-10 05:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6535348, 969965, 87278, '<td valign="top">Camera catching the calf catcher! Apt interpretation of the Challenge theme - stopping the calf in motion!</td>', 'Camera catching the calf catcher! Apt interpretation of the Challenge theme - stopping the calf in motion!', '2011-09-10 05:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6535349, 969841, 87278, '<td valign="top">The title is catchy as is the image. Very imaginative.</td>', 'The title is catchy as is the image. Very imaginative.', '2011-09-10 05:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6535352, 970252, 87278, '<td valign="top">The humble shower gets its 15-min of fame!<br/>I like the choice of subject and the camera work. <br/> <br/>I am not a photographer. As a layman I just was wondering whether the maker''s markings on the shower head is a distraction. <br/> <br/>I am happy to add this cool piece of work to my favs.</td>', 'The humble shower gets its 15-min of fame!I like the choice of subject and the camera work.  I am not a photographer. As a layman I just was wondering whether the maker''s markings on the shower head is a distraction.  I am happy to add this cool piece of work to my favs.', '2011-09-10 05:55:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6535353, 970216, 87278, '<td valign="top">An off beat interpretation of the the theme! Nonetheless very apt. The trudging along by the lonely man (in a crowd!) shows how ''forced'' the motion is. Brilliant capture of the atmosphere that accentuates the mood and tells a story a thousand words cannot!<br/> <br/>Added to my favs!</td>', 'An off beat interpretation of the the theme! Nonetheless very apt. The trudging along by the lonely man (in a crowd!) shows how ''forced'' the motion is. Brilliant capture of the atmosphere that accentuates the mood and tells a story a thousand words cannot! Added to my favs!', '2011-09-10 06:04:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6535354, 969745, 87278, '<td valign="top">I like the gloomy effect! The b/w works for me pretty well.</td>', 'I like the gloomy effect! The b/w works for me pretty well.', '2011-09-10 06:11:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6535355, 970257, 87278, '<td valign="top">I can sense the deafening noise it wd be making under there! The rainbow adds color and cheer to what is otherwise a sense of awe.</td>', 'I can sense the deafening noise it wd be making under there! The rainbow adds color and cheer to what is otherwise a sense of awe.', '2011-09-10 06:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6535356, 969749, 87278, '<td valign="top">Although I live close to the airport past 32 years, a take off always gives me a thrill! Especially the moment the wheels just lose contact with the ground. I like the angle the wheels make with the ground.<br/></td>', 'Although I live close to the airport past 32 years, a take off always gives me a thrill! Especially the moment the wheels just lose contact with the ground. I like the angle the wheels make with the ground.', '2011-09-10 06:21:46.000000', NULL, 0);
